<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  6.37%			 C/S = 6.36%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.10%			 O/N = 6.79%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.10%			 T/N = 7.64%</p>
<p>		   Dec  16, 1996			Dec  13, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.15%	1 month forward =  7.46%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.64%	2 month forward =  7.47%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.70%	3 month forward =  7.58%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.90%	4 month forward =  7.81%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.81%	5 month forward =  7.74%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.54%	6 month forward =  7.48%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
